title: "Flywheel"
abstract: "Flywheel (v2.1.0) is a model-neutral AI gateway, Rowan provider router, Three-Plate and PUCT oracle verification harness with Merkle trace compression, pure-stdlib MIT verification harnesses (BuildOS, crypto, GPU, WASM, SBOM, MIR assurance, and ZK attestation), local RTX 4090 and Colab RLVR model forge, and offline-verifiable engine-receipt/1 ledger recheckable with Python's standard library alone."
